This React project is another iteration of the password-gen project. It generates letters lowercase and uppercase and
has toggle buttons to select numbers or special characters. The password has a maximum length of 100 characters.
The display of this password generator is styled and will show an error message if special characters or numbers
are not included in the password. You also have a copy password option and when copied a copied message is displayed.
To view this project, type in the following commands in the terminal:
cd password-gen
npm run dev
To access localhost server address: http://localhost:5173
